      "obj_id": "docs/wayland/WLD-01-SESSION-SHM-PRESENTATION.md#0.1.0-rationale",
      "text": "The existing display trait supplies a useful compatibility boundary but cannot\nown Wayland callbacks and lifecycle alone. A session plus a complete private\nframe closes protocol ownership and rotating-buffer correctness without\nchanging public display or Python APIs during concurrent MPY/CPython work."
    },
